 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5510+) Sevopedia — Corporations: **reworked** and **beautified** the page layout, with **new Competes With, Bonuses Consumed, Bonuses Generated, and Movie** panels. Exposed `getBonusProduced` to Python in [CvInfo_Organization.h](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvInfo_Organization.h), [CvInfo_Organization.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvInfo_Organization.cpp), and [CyInfoInterface3.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CyInfoInterface3.cpp) so the new generated-bonus panel is cleanly supported. See [Sevopedia reworks (Corporations)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-15-corporations-category).
 - Many entries (religions, some techs/buildings/units/bonuses/terrains/features) now use neutral encyclopedia-style blurbs (often Wikipedia-based) for clarity/context.
 - Sevopedia — Traits: New **Trait Charts**: 2 **sortable** charts showing how widespread **pairs are in a Trait**, and **ranking for each Trait combination**, with **clickable leader buttons**. The Leaders' panel's **header shows statistics** (e.g. "Leader 12/53 (22%)"). Additionally, **Beautified** and added a **new Background panel** with **mod-agnostic blurbs**. See [Sevopedia reworks (Traits)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-15-traits-category-traits-charts-and-other-changes).
-- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5692+) Added a new **Votes category** featuring **exhaustive XML info** about `VoteSourceInfos` (e.g., Apostolic Palace, UN) and `VoteInfo` (e.g., a resolution/vote). Votes are **grouped by vote source**, **abriged** in item bar when necessary. Example of panels include notably Source Civic, Source Free Specialist, Vote's Requirements, Effects, Force Civics. Also added if relevant corresponding Vote Source and Vote panels or blurbs in Sevopedia Civics and Specialists. Moved Vote XML **read time** from to `CvXMLLoadUtility::LoadPostMenuGlobals` to `CvXMLLoadUtility::LoadPreMenuGlobals` (else sevopedia votes would be empty until a game is started). Added **"Legend"** text similarly. See also [KI#121](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#121---fixed-base-advciv-bug-cvvotesourceinfo-parses-religioncommerces-into-the-wrong-array) and [Sevopedia reworks (Votes category)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-041-votes-category-voteinfo-and-votesourceinfos).
+- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5692+) New **Votes category** featuring **exhaustive XML info** about `VoteSourceInfos` (e.g., Apostolic Palace, UN) and `VoteInfo` (e.g., a resolution/vote). Votes are **grouped by vote source**, **abriged** in item bar when necessary. Example of panels include notably Source Civic, Source Free Specialist, Vote's Requirements, Effects, Force Civics. Also added if relevant corresponding Vote Source and Vote panels or blurbs in Sevopedia Civics and Specialists. Added **"Legend"** text similarly. See also [KI#121](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#121---fixed-base-advciv-bug-cvvotesourceinfo-parses-religioncommerces-into-the-wrong-array) and [Sevopedia reworks (Votes category)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-041-votes-category-voteinfo-and-votesourceinfos).
+- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5705+) New **Event Triggers category** featuring **exhaustive XML info** about `CvEventTriggerInfo` (e.g., "Careless Apprentice") and `CvEventInfo` (e.g., event 1: "Organize a rebuilding effort; event 2: "Investigate the cause of the fire"; event 3: "We are too pressed to spare any attention to a small fire") and their detailed effects, with a **"Legend"** similarly. The implementation notably has repeated text prevention (e.g., use "x2", "x3" when bullets are the same), sevopedia links to other assets' pages (like traits in sevopedia leader), and **direct and indirect era groupings** (depending on whether the eventtrigger depends on tech's and/or prereqs directly or on related assets' related own conditions; see sevopedia legend).
 - Sevopedia — Techs: New **Starting Techs Charts**: **sortable** charts showing Civilization **pairs and combinations** for **each starting tech**, mirroring the Traits' Charts. New **Untradeable Techs** Chart shows per era untradeable techs similarly. Add a new **Obsoletes panel** showing **Buttons (i.e. icons) of obsolete assets**, with an updated **thinner RedX art**. Also **beautified** with a new **Enables** panel enriched with **more information** (Civics, Promotions, Bonuses, various effects such as "Centers World Map", "Can Adjust Commerce Rate", etc.), and a **new First to Discover** panel (Founds Religion, Receives a Great Person, Receives a Free Tech) and **Untradeable panel** for the currently selected tech (Emoji or "Yes"). See [Sevopedia reworks (Techs)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-10-techs-category).
 - Sevopedia — Specialists: new **Extra Slots** (showing slot, free slots, unlimited specialists) and **Extra Yields** panel showing detailed yield information per asset for each specialist.
 - Sevopedia — Units: (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5672+) Notably prepend **unique names** before the **pedia text** in the History (i.e. the "Background") panel; e.g., "Albert Einstein", "Plato" for the Great Scientist unit; "Sargon", "Sun Tzu" for the Great General unit. See also [Sevopedia reworks (Unit List)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-7-unit-list-category).
